      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "Scope permission accessibility for:\n\nrw_ads (read/write).\n\nr_ads (read-only)\n\nThe authenticated Ad Account user that provides consent has one of the following roles on the Ad Account:\n\nACCOUNT_BILLING_ADMIN\n\nACCOUNT_MANAGER\n\nCAMPAIGN_MANAGER\n\nCREATIVE_MANAGER\n\nVIEWER (read-only, even with rw_ads scope)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
