            ],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "TargetingCriteria is the object that represents an Audience. It provides a generic AND / OR construct to include and exclude different targeting facets when defining an audience. TargetingCriteria defines the audience, for example, members who are skilled in Java and work for ABC company.",
